      "name": "configure-device",
      "description": "Pick the capture device (index 0, the OS default). On a capture-capable host this triggers a REAL live reinit: the OS device opens (or fails cleanly on a locked-down host) while the pipeline renders, the desktop equivalent of the install fan-out's pin writes. The pipeline must keep rendering through it. Optional: the control exists only where hasAudioCapture is true, so board targets record a clean skip.",
